                                        "entry_id": "d46fc55b-1dab-3705-be2b-5bb24522be60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a bicyclic heterocyclic phenolic compound, formed in the body by the metabolism of protein and excreted in the urine (or in faeces, as in birds and insects)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
